Package: CIRI
Type: Package
Title: CIRI CRISPR Screen Analysis Pipeline
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alessandro", "Bertero", role = c("aut")),
    person("Maria Luisa", "Ratto",  role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ratto@example.com")
  )
Description: End-to-end analysis pipeline for CIRI single-cell CRISPRa/i
    screens. Covers guide name harmonisation, perturbation assignment with
    KDE-based auto-thresholding, Seurat v5 QC with mito/ribo plots, Monocle3
    preprocessing at multiple clustering resolutions, cluster enrichment,
    pseudotime statistics, and gene signature scoring. Standalone scripts for
    QC and filtering are included in inst/scripts/.
